<section><h2 class="ref-sec-title">In the profiles</h2><ul class="yr-prof"><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/numidia"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Numidia.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Numidia</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Caesar defeats Juba I at Thapsus and creates the province of Africa Nova</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/africa-proconsularis"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Africa%20Proconsularis.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Africa Proconsularis</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Caesar annexes Numidian lands as Africa Nova after Thapsus</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/battle/battle-of-alesia"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Battle%20of%20Alesia.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Battle of Alesia</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Vercingetorix is paraded in Caesar's triumph and garrotted</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/battle/battle-of-thapsus"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Battle%20of%20Thapsus.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Battle of Thapsus</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Caesar's foraging force is nearly overcome by Petreius and Labienus near Ruspina but withdraws to the town</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/battle/battle-of-thapsus"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Battle%20of%20Thapsus.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Battle of Thapsus</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Caesar besieges Thapsus and Scipio marches round the Marsh of Moknine to meet him</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/battle/battle-of-thapsus"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Battle%20of%20Thapsus.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Battle of Thapsus</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Caesar's army defeats the Optimate army at Thapsus</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/battle/battle-of-thapsus"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Battle%20of%20Thapsus.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Battle of Thapsus</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Cato kills himself at Utica, and Juba and Petreius die in a duel</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/battle/battle-of-thapsus"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Battle%20of%20Thapsus.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Battle of Thapsus</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Caesar returns to Rome</span></li></ul></section>
